00:00:19.753 --> 00:00:22.489 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 C'est le cas de Michael Chow.

00:00:20.754 --> 00:00:23.490 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il voudrait quitter son emploi

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:28.061 size:53% position:73% line:53%
