00:00:22.823 --> 00:00:28.061 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour travailler dans les

00:00:23.824 --> 00:00:28.061 size:53% position:73% line:53%
énergies renouvela

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:34.735 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Pour lui, le boom solaire est

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.769 size:53% position:73% line:53%
loin d'être abstrait.

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:36.803 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Chaque semaine, il passe

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:37.838 size:53% position:73% line:53%
