00:00:36.103 --> 00:00:38.872 size:53% position:73% line:53%
construite au bord de

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:39.873 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'autoroute transcanadienne.

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.907 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et l'intérêt se maintient,

00:00:39.206 --> 00:00:45.812 size:53% position:73% line:53%
