00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:29.322 size:53% position:73% line:53%
NAGWAN AL-GUNEID, présidente,

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:30.357 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Business Renewable Centre

00:01:28.622 --> 00:01:31.391 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Comme les opérations de

00:01:29.656 --> 00:01:32.392 size:53% position:73% line:53%
